s/3c9d0a991960f1c80f45eeb3d19bd0ef.poster.avif?t=1755030884\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157310/extras/3c9d0a991960f1c80f45eeb3d19bd0ef.webm?t=1755030884\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157310/extras/3c9d0a991960f1c80f45eeb3d19bd0ef.mp4?t=1755030884\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each of the three stories has multiple endings to explore and unlock.</p>",
